## 1. API Endpoint Reference

### API #62 — Add Application Question

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/add_job_question/:jobId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |
| **Rate Limit** | 50 req/min |

#### Request Body

````carousel
**MCQ Single (radio buttons)**
```json
{
  "question_text": "What is your preferred work location?",
  "question_type": "mcq_single",
  "question_options": ["Mumbai", "Pune", "Bangalore", "Hyderabad", "Remote"],
  "is_required": true
}
```
<!-- slide -->
**MCQ Multiple (checkboxes)**
```json
{
  "question_text": "Which programming languages are you proficient in?",
  "question_type": "mcq_multiple",
  "question_options": ["Java", "Python", "JavaScript", "C++", "Go", "Rust"],
  "is_required": true
}
```
<!-- slide -->
**Text (short answer)**
```json
{
  "question_text": "What is your expected CTC?",
  "question_type": "text",
  "is_required": false
}
```
<!-- slide -->
**Essay (long answer)**
```json
{
  "question_text": "Why do you want to work at our company? Describe your motivation.",
  "question_type": "essay",
  "is_required": true
}
```
<!-- slide -->
**Yes/No**
```json
{
  "question_text": "Are you willing to relocate?",
  "question_type": "yes_no",
  "is_required": true
}
```
````

| Field | Type | Required | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `question_text` | string | ✅ Yes | 5–2000 chars |
| `question_type` | string | ✅ Yes | `mcq_single`, `mcq_multiple`, `text`, `essay`, `yes_no` |
| `question_options` | string[] | ✅ If MCQ | 2–20 items, no duplicates, each 1–500 chars. **Must be null/absent** for non-MCQ. |
| `is_required` | boolean | ❌ Optional | Defaults to `true` |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> `question_order` is **auto-calculated** (MAX + 1). Do not send it.
> For MCQ types, `question_options` is **required**. For text/essay/yes_no, it must be **null or omitted**.

#### Success Response (201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Application question added successfully",
  "data": {
    "question_id": "a1b2c3d4-...",
    "job_id": "e5f6g7h8-...",
    "question_text": "What is your preferred work location?",
    "question_type": "mcq_single",
    "question_options": ["Mumbai", "Pune", "Bangalore", "Hyderabad", "Remote"],
    "is_required": true,
    "question_order": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-04T05:30:00.000Z",
    "job_title": "Software Developer",
    "company_name": "TCS"
  }
}
```

