### API #63 — Get Job Questions

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `GET` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/get_job_questions/:jobId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |
| **Rate Limit** | None (GET) |

#### Success Response (200)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Job questions retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "questions": [
      {
        "question_id": "...",
        "job_id": "...",
        "question_text": "Are you willing to relocate?",
        "question_type": "yes_no",
        "question_options": null,
        "is_required": true,
        "question_order": 1,
        "created_at": "...",
        "job_title": "Software Developer",
        "company_name": "TCS"
      },
      { "...more questions ordered by question_order..." }
    ],
    "total": 5,
    "job_title": "Software Developer",
    "company_name": "TCS"
  }
}
```

