## 3. Integration Guide

### Relationship to Existing & Future APIs

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Job Postings API] --> B[Job Positions]
    A --> C[Job Eligibility Criteria]
    A --> D[Job Rounds]
    A --> E["App Questions ✨ NEW"]
    E --> F["Application Answers ❌ Future"]
    F --> G["Student Applications ❌ Future"]
```

### Data Lifecycle

1. **Create Job** (draft) → jobId
2. Add Positions, Criteria, Rounds
3. **Add Application Questions** ← *this module*
4. **Publish Job** (students can now see the questions)
5. **Students apply** → submit answers to these questions (future: `application_answers`)
6. Questions are **locked once applications exist** — cannot edit/delete

### FK Relationships

| Column | References | ON DELETE |
|--------|-----------|-----------|
| `application_questions.job_id` | `job_postings.job_id` | CASCADE |
| `application_answers.question_id` | `application_questions.question_id` | CASCADE |

### Frontend Navigation

```
Job List → Job Detail Page
             ├── Positions Tab
             ├── Eligibility Tab
             ├── Rounds Tab
             └── Questions Tab  ← shows list + add/edit/delete
```

