## 4. Postman Test Payloads

### Add MCQ Single
```json
POST /api/college/add_job_question/{{jobId}}
{
  "question_text": "What is your preferred work location?",
  "question_type": "mcq_single",
  "question_options": ["Mumbai", "Pune", "Bangalore", "Hyderabad", "Remote"],
  "is_required": true
}
```

### Add MCQ Multiple
```json
POST /api/college/add_job_question/{{jobId}}
{
  "question_text": "Select your proficient programming languages",
  "question_type": "mcq_multiple",
  "question_options": ["Java", "Python", "JavaScript", "C++", "Go"],
  "is_required": true
}
```

### Add Text
```json
POST /api/college/add_job_question/{{jobId}}
{
  "question_text": "What is your expected CTC (in LPA)?",
  "question_type": "text",
  "is_required": false
}
```

### Add Essay
```json
POST /api/college/add_job_question/{{jobId}}
{
  "question_text": "Describe a challenging project you worked on and your role in it",
  "question_type": "essay",
  "is_required": true
}
```

### Add Yes/No
```json
POST /api/college/add_job_question/{{jobId}}
{
  "question_text": "Are you willing to work in shifts?",
  "question_type": "yes_no",
  "is_required": true
}
```

### Update — Change type from text to MCQ
```json
PUT /api/college/update_question/{{questionId}}
{
  "question_type": "mcq_single",
  "question_options": ["Yes, anywhere", "Preferred city only", "Remote only"]
}
```

### Update — Reorder
```json
PUT /api/college/update_question/{{questionId}}
{
  "question_order": 1
}
```

### Delete
```
DELETE /api/college/delete_question/{{questionId}}
```

