## 5. Edge Case Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected |
|---|----------|----------|
| 1 | Add MCQ with no options | 422 — "MCQ questions must have at least 2 options" |
| 2 | Add MCQ with 1 option | 422 — min 2 |
| 3 | Add MCQ with 21 options | 422 — max 20 |
| 4 | Add MCQ with duplicate options | 422 — "Duplicate options not allowed" |
| 5 | Add text question with options array | 422 — "Options should not be provided for non-MCQ" |
| 6 | Add yes_no with options | 422 |
| 7 | Add to cancelled job | 400 |
| 8 | Add to closed job | 400 |
| 9 | Add duplicate question text (case-insensitive) | 409 |
| 10 | Add with `question_text` < 5 chars | 422 |
| 11 | Add with minimal: text + type only | 201 ✅ |
| 12 | Get questions for job with 0 questions | 200 — empty array, total: 0 |
| 13 | Get questions — wrong college | 404 |
| 14 | Update question in published job WITH applications | 400 — locked |
| 15 | Update question in published job WITHOUT applications | 200 ✅ |
| 16 | Update — change type MCQ → text | 200 — options auto-cleared |
| 17 | Update — change type text → MCQ without options | 400 — options required |
| 18 | Update — change type text → MCQ WITH options | 200 ✅ |
| 19 | Update — empty body | 422 — min 1 field |
| 20 | Update — duplicate question text | 409 |
| 21 | Delete from cancelled job | 400 |
| 22 | Delete from published job WITH applications | 400 |
| 23 | Delete from draft job | 200 ✅ |
| 24 | Delete — verify remaining questions reordered | Orders: 1,2,3 → delete #2 → orders become 1,2 |
| 25 | Unauthorized role (TEACHER) | 403 |
| 26 | No auth token | 401 |
| 27 | Add MCQ with empty-string option `["Good", "", "Bad"]` | 422 — option invalid |
| 28 | Add 20 questions to same job sequentially | 201 each, orders 1–20 |
